This project contains a modified TypeScript port of the Codex apply-patch parser,
text-update and line-matching logic, its Lark grammar, and copied regression
fixtures from https://github.com/openai/codex at commit:
a6fdb11eda992b706c5e6a21ae5fd8c7376f8e06

Upstream sources:
- codex-rs/apply-patch/src/{parser,streaming_parser,file_update,seek_sequence,text_file}.rs
- codex-rs/core/assets/tools/apply_patch.lark
- codex-rs/apply-patch/tests/fixtures/scenarios/

Modifications: non-streaming TypeScript implementation, BOM handling, byte-preserving
no-op updates and net-change reporting, bounded structured diff reports for
optional UI adapters, local filesystem preflight and per-file atomic replacement,
Pi tool integration, resource limits, and additional tests.
See README.md for intentional behavioral differences. No Codex CLI, Rust runtime,
sandbox, or Ratatui code is included.

